WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.910
Turn everyday numbers into binary and see every bit light up.

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:08.107
42 = 32 + 8 + 2.

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:11.303
Set those bit positions to 1: 00101010₂.

00:00:11.303 --> 00:00:15.870
Check by adding 32 + 8 + 2 = 42.

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:19.545
What is the decimal value of 1010₂?

00:00:19.545 --> 00:00:22.985
1×8 + 0×4 + 1×2 + 0×1 = 10.
